From 088e02b9f34cda7fdaf68810900c6fd7075cff61 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ylevavi <yehuda.levavi@tandemg.com>
Date: Tue, 05 Oct 2021 14:34:24 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-56463] spi driver: refactor to generic

Make preboot SPI driver generic so it will support both SPI flash and
SPI TPM devices.
Former spi_* API prefix functions that were related to spi flash changed
to spi_flash_*.

Change-Id: Ibc4c70d8d2cf74ab98409904adc7ca5a81a895d8
Signed-off-by: ylevavi <yehuda.levavi@tandemg.com>
---

